{%- comment -%}
  HYDRIX — premium CSS product-bottle placeholder (used when a product card has no image).
  Styling is scoped per-section via .hxh-bottle / .hxh-bottle__* (see hxh-lineup.liquid).
  Spans (not divs) are used for sub-parts so Dawn's `div:empty { display:none }` can't hide them.
  Usage: {% render 'hxh-bottle', name: 'DAILY' %}
{%- endcomment -%}
<div class="hxh-bottle" aria-hidden="true">
  <span class="hxh-bottle__lid"></span>
  <span class="hxh-bottle__stripe"></span>
  {%- if name != blank -%}<span class="hxh-bottle__name">{{ name }}</span>{%- endif -%}
</div>
